        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 32.16,
          "end": 35.19,
          "en": "They will be smaller once we built the app for production",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 35.19,
          "end": 37.68,
          "en": "because this code is not optimized at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.68,
          "end": 40.02,
          "en": "It contains many debug features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 40.02,
          "end": 43.86,
          "en": "so it will be way smaller later and we'll see that later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 43.86,
          "end": 45.84,
          "en": "But at the moment you see we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 45.84,
          "end": 47.22,
          "en": "pretty big files here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 47.22,
          "end": 49.53,
          "en": "4 megabytes, 100 kilobytes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 49.53,
          "end": 51.09,
          "en": "almost a megabyte,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 51.09,
          "end": 53.22,
          "en": "236 kilobytes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 53.22,
          "end": 55.5,
          "en": "Now again, this will shrink significantly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 55.5,
          "end": 58.23,
          "en": "but still this is our current file size.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 58.23,
          "end": 59.22,
          "en": "With lazy loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 59.22,
          "end": 61.56,
          "en": "We should be able to decrease that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 61.56,
          "end": 63.69,
          "en": "How do we add lazy loading though?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 63.69,
          "end": 66.27,
          "en": "Let's start with the recipes module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 66.27,
          "end": 68.01,
          "en": "Because for example here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 68.01,
          "end": 69.75,
          "en": "when we're not authenticated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 69.75,
          "end": 72.96000000000001,
          "en": "we certainly don't need to load the recipes module code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 72.96000000000001,
          "end": 75.18,
          "en": "because we can't even access anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 75.18,
          "end": 77.46000000000001,
          "en": "from the recipes module here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 77.46000000000001,
          "end": 78.66,
          "en": "It might also not make sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 78.66,
          "end": 80.16,
          "en": "to load the shopping list module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 80.16,
          "end": 81.6,
          "en": "even though we can access it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 81.6,
          "end": 83.1,
          "en": "because unless we do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 83.1,
          "end": 85.65,
          "en": "there is no need to download that code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 85.65,
          "end": 88.47,
          "en": "So let's start with the recipes module nonetheless.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 88.47,
          "end": 90.51,
          "en": "There, we have the recipes module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 90.51,
          "end": 92.37,
          "en": "and we have its own routes here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 92.37,
          "end": 94.62,
          "en": "in the recipes routing module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 94.62,
          "end": 98.28,
          "en": "Now, having the routes registered here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 98.28,
          "end": 100.56,
          "en": "is an important starting point.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 100.56,
          "end": 102,
          "en": "For a lazy loading to work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 102,
          "end": 105.45,
          "en": "your feature module needs to bring its own routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 105.45,
          "end": 106.53,
          "en": "As we're doing it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 106.53,
          "end": 108.69,
          "en": "it needs to bring its own route conflict.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 108.69,
          "end": 110.88,
          "en": "We're doing that here and it needs to bring that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 110.88,
          "end": 114.06,
          "en": "with forChild, which is also what we're doing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 114.06,
          "end": 116.61,
          "en": "Now one thing we'll need to change though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 116.61,
          "end": 119.03999999999999,
          "en": "that path recipes here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 119.03999999999999,
          "end": 119.87299999999999,
          "en": "I will change it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 119.87299999999999,
          "end": 121.2,
          "en": "to an empty path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 121.2,
          "end": 123.06,
          "en": "because now we need to add something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 123.06,
          "end": 124.92,
          "en": "to our app routing module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 124.92,
          "end": 126.93,
          "en": "for lazy loading to work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 126.93,
          "end": 129.78,
          "en": "Here, I'll again add another route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 129.78,
          "end": 131.97,
          "en": "and that will be the route for recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 131.97,
          "end": 136.26,
          "en": "So the path I just removed from the recipes module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 136.26,
          "end": 138.48,
          "en": "Now here I'm in the app routing module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 138.48,
          "end": 139.82999999999998,
          "en": "Important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 139.82999999999998,
          "end": 142.44,
          "en": "I add that path again here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 142.44,
          "end": 143.43,
          "en": "but now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 143.43,
          "end": 146.04,
          "en": "I don't add a component which I wanna load",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 146.04,
          "end": 148.95,
          "en": "but instead you add loadChildren.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 148.95,
          "end": 152.57999999999998,
          "en": "That's a special property in a route conflict",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 152.57999999999998,
          "end": 155.34,
          "en": "which Angular understands as",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 155.34,
          "end": 157.41,
          "en": "please only load",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 157.41,
          "end": 159.3,
          "en": "the code content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 159.3,
          "end": 161.97,
          "en": "or the module I'm going to point you at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 161.97,
          "end": 166.5,
          "en": "when anyone, when the user visits this path here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 166.5,
          "end": 168.75,
          "en": "Now let me show you what this means.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 168.75,
          "end": 169.9,
          "en": "We can now add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 171.09,
          "end": 171.93,
          "en": "a string here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 171.93,
          "end": 173.25,
          "en": "not a type,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 173.25,
          "end": 175.77,
          "en": "not a component type you pointed, but a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 175.77,
          "end": 179.67000000000002,
          "en": "which is a path to the module you wanna load when this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 179.67000000000002,
          "end": 182.55,
          "en": "or when this path here is visited.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 182.55,
          "end": 185.64,
          "en": "And I of course wanna load",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 185.64,
          "end": 187.99,
          "en": "relatively from the app routing module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 189.57,
          "end": 192.39,
          "en": "my recipes folder and there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 192.39,
          "end": 195.3,
          "en": "the recipes module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 195.3,
          "end": 198.077,
          "en": "not the recipes routing module, but the recipes module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 198.957,
          "end": 201.372,
          "en": "And now you also need to add something here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 201.372,
          "end": 202.20499999999998,
          "en": "You know it's not just a path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 202.20499999999998,
          "end": 205.05,
          "en": "but you also need to add the name of that module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 205.05,
          "end": 206.64,
          "en": "because Angular can't know that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 206.64,
          "end": 208.11,
          "en": "and it needs to know the class name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 208.11,
          "end": 209.31,
          "en": "because technically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 209.31,
          "end": 211.35,
          "en": "it will go to that path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 211.35,
          "end": 213.63,
          "en": "and then try to dynamically import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 213.63,
          "end": 216.75,
          "en": "a specific object from that file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 216.75,
          "end": 219.15,
          "en": "and theoretically that could be named anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 219.15,
          "end": 221.67000000000002,
          "en": "We are of course following that naming convention",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 221.67000000000002,
          "end": 225.27,
          "en": "of naming this recipes module in this casing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 225.27,
          "end": 228.39,
          "en": "when the file name hat is named recipes.module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 228.39,
          "end": 231.3,
          "en": "but no one is forcing us to follow that naming pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 231.3,
          "end": 234.36,
          "en": "and therefore we explicitly have to tell Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 234.36,
          "end": 239.25,
          "en": "what the name of the exported class in that file is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 239.25,
          "end": 243.09,
          "en": "And you add that by adding a hashtag and then that name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 243.09,
          "end": 248,
          "en": "so lowChildren points at ./recipes/recipes.module.ts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 248.97,
          "end": 252.84,
          "en": "and then hashtag and the name of that class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 252.84,
          "end": 255.09,
          "en": "The effect of that will be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 255.09,
          "end": 259.23,
          "en": "that now the code is split at that point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 259.23,
          "end": 262.08,
          "en": "and everything at this path here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 262.08,
          "end": 266.13,
          "en": "so this entire module and everything that module uses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 266.13,
          "end": 268.5,
          "en": "so all the declarations of that module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 268.5,
          "end": 271.38,
          "en": "will be put into a separate code bundle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 271.38,
          "end": 272.82,
          "en": "which is then downloaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 272.82,
          "end": 277.17,
          "en": "and parsed on the demand as soon as a user visits this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 277.17,
          "end": 278.703,
          "en": "but not sooner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 280.44,
          "end": 282.03,
          "en": "And that is simply achieved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 282.03,
          "end": 286.5,
          "en": "by the Angular CLI essentially analyzing this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 286.5,
          "end": 288,
          "en": "when we build our app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 288,
          "end": 290.67,
          "en": "and it will then analyze the recipes module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 290.67,
          "end": 292.62,
          "en": "at which we point here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 292.62,
          "end": 296.37,
          "en": "and it will look at what we declare in here and so on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 296.37,
          "end": 299.94,
          "en": "and will put the code of all these things we declare here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 299.94,
          "end": 303.3,
          "en": "into that separate bundle which is now built separately",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 303.3,
          "end": 307.65,
          "en": "detached from our main bundle with which the app starts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 307.65,
          "end": 310.44,
          "en": "Important for this to have a real effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 310.44,
          "end": 313.8,
          "en": "and safe code is that you have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 313.8,
          "end": 316.89,
          "en": "these import statements only in the recipes module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 316.89,
          "end": 319.74,
          "en": "and you don't have any old import statements to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 319.74,
          "end": 321.24,
          "en": "let's say the recipes component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 321.24,
          "end": 323.07,
          "en": "in let's say the app module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 323.07,
          "end": 325.56,
          "en": "Because ultimately for the build process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 325.56,
          "end": 328.59,
          "en": "it's important what you import here at the top,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 328.59,
          "end": 329.73,
          "en": "what you import here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 329.73,
          "end": 332.19,
          "en": "like that forms module, which I should remove",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 332.19,
          "end": 333.33,
          "en": "in the app module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 333.33,
          "end": 334.56,
          "en": "What you import here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 334.56,
          "end": 337.77,
          "en": "is all bundled together into one code bundle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 337.77,
          "end": 339.39,
          "en": "So in the recipes module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 339.39,
          "end": 340.26,
          "en": "in the end,",
